## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `rows:` | `Integer` | `3` | Visible lines before it scrolls; also the frame's starting height. |
| `value:` | `String` | - | The content. |
| `variant:` | `:outline`, `:soft` | `:outline` | Bordered or filled. |
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | `:md` | Padding and text size. |
| `start_slot:` / `end_slot:` | `Symbol`, `String`, `Proc` | - | Adornments aligned to the first line. |
| `clearable:` | `Boolean` | `false` | A ✕ that empties the field once it has a value. |
| `invalid:` | `Boolean` | - | Paints the error state and sets `aria-invalid`. |
| `textarea:` | `Hash` | `{}` | Attributes for the inner `<textarea>` when it's wrapped. |

## Accessibility

- Label it like an Input: a Field, a `<label for>` or `aria_label:`.
- A live counter in a slot should not be announced on every keystroke; keep it out of `aria-live` regions.
